The company says its service advisors and mechanics are highly trained and focused on a stress-free customer experience. Its stated mission is to provide quality vehicle service at affordable prices, and its site also lists a right-to-repair service. Drivers in Nirvana who want regular servicing or repairs for a bakkie or car can use the workshop on Gypsum Street.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://cartime.co.za/about'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'cartime-nirvana-nirvana' AND description = 'CARtime Nirvana is a car service and repair workshop in Nirvana, offering bakkie and car servicing, repairs, maintenance, electronic diagnostics, and suspension, brake and clutch repairs.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
